  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "おはようございまーす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020010"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あー！　果穂、いいところに来た！\r\nお菓子、一緒に食べる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020020"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ちょこ先輩……！　いいんですか！？\r\nえへへ、ありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020030"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……いろんなお菓子がありますね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ、チョコアイドルだもん！\r\n仕事のためにも、お菓子の研究してるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "うわ～……！\r\nやっぱり、ちょこ先輩はスゴいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020060"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nこれは……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あはは、すぐ見つけたね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ヒーローのおもちゃが入ってるお菓子！\r\nあたし、これ好きなんです……どうしてここにっ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "気に入るかなと思って、買ってきたんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わあ！　ちょこ先輩、スゴいです！　これ、どこに行っても\r\n品切れで……ずっと欲しかったんです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私はおもちゃ集めてないから、\r\nおもちゃは果穂にあげるよ！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いいんですか！？\r\nありがとうございますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……あっでも、全部もらっちゃうのは悪いので、\r\nチョコは返しますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "え、いいの？\r\nそれじゃあ、食べちゃおっかな♪",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ふむふむ……ん！　このチョコ、おいしい！\r\n食玩のお菓子もあなどれないなぁ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……中身は……\r\nあっ、ジャスティスレッドでした！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……「よく来たな、ジャスティスレッド\r\nここが、お前の墓場となるのだ！」",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "「くっ、よくも平和な街を……\r\n許せん、絶対にお前を倒す！」",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020190"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あはは。果穂は本当にヒーローが好きなんだね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　あたし、ヒーローみたいな\r\nアイドルになりたいので！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020210"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "最近、レッスンもだけど、テレビのお仕事もあったよね！\r\nすごく忙しいけど、果穂は大丈夫なの？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんですよっ！\r\n『ジャスティスＶ』も最近見れてなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020230"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あれだけ忙しいと、見る時間もなかなか取れないよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020240"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも大丈夫です！\r\nお仕事はとっても楽しいですし！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020250"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "テレビはちゃんと、録画してますから！\r\nお休みができたら、一気に見るんです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020260"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そっか、そうだよね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020270"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……ねえねえ、果穂\r\n私も一緒に遊んでもいいっ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020280"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　もちろんです！\r\nじゃあちょこ先輩は……この悪の大帝役です！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
