    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020320"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ふふふ、ならばこちらも奥の手を使うしかないな\r\nくらえ、ジャスティスレッド……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020330"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "くっ、だが負けられない！　正義の可能性は無限大だ！\r\nいくぞ、ジャスティストリーム！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020340"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ぐわぁ！　おのれジャスティスレッド……\r\nだが、こちらもまだ負けられないのだ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020350"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……アナタたち、何してるの？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900402/3009004020360"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっ、夏葉ちゃん。ちょうどいいところに！\r\n哀れな怪人に手を貸してくださいー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
